{+	\leanok+}
{+	\uses{lem:qld-4-10, lem:qld-completed-point-answers, def:line-point-dist}+}
{+	Completion leaves the defect unchanged+}
{+	(Lemma~\ref{lem:qld-completed-point-answers}). The point marginal of the+}
{+	line-point law is uniform and the two samples are independent, so the+}
{+	average over the product law equals the average over uniformly random+}
{+	$x, z$, which~\eqref{eq:qld-q-self-cons} bounds by $\delta_Q$. Exchanging+}
